# 8. CORE UPLOAD EXPERIENCE

The conceptual flow is:

```text
User selects files
        ↓
Preflight
        ↓
Queue
        ↓
Acquire upload slot
        ↓
Request upload
        ↓
Receive mediaId + signed PUT information
        ↓
PUT original bytes to R2
        ↓
Confirm same mediaId
        ↓
Reconcile
        ↓
Refresh media
        ↓
Timeline displays media
```

This is the core vertical path.

Do not lose sight of it while building UI details.

