# 22. REQUEST / PUT / CONFIRM

Treat these as distinct operations.

### Request

Establish the media upload identity and obtain the authorized upload information.

### PUT

Upload the original bytes to R2.

### Confirm

Confirm the already-uploaded object using the existing media identity.

Do not collapse these steps into a single conceptual operation.

