# 27. CANCELLATION

Follow the Phase 6 cancellation tiers.

### Core

Queued items can be cancelled.

### Tier 2

Uploading items may support cancellation/abort if browser APIs and the implementation make it reliable.

### Not cancellable

Do not pretend that:

* requesting
* confirming

can be safely cancelled once the server operation is underway.

If an operation has already completed, cancellation cannot retroactively undo it.

